      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**The \"Aha!\" Moment Demo**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-290",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Scenario**: A quant developer building a trading strategy"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-291",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Import Excel model** → Instantly converts to LD-C with dependency graph"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-292",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Change risk parameter** → Watch all dependent calculations update in real-time"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-293",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Add constraint** → \"Maximum drawdown < 20%\" → Immediately see violations highlighted"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-294",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **Share with colleague** → They can understand the entire model in minutes instead of hours"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-295",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. **Deploy to production** → One-click deployment with guaranteed identical behavior"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-296",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**The Magic**: What used to take weeks of spreadsheet debugging and code translation now happens in **minutes** with mathematical certainty."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-297",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Competitive Landscape**"
        }
